{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46253","headline":"题成都玉局观孙位画龙 · 贯休","name":"题成都玉局观孙位画龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见苏州崑山佛殿中，金城柱上有二龙。\n老僧相传道是僧繇手，寻常入海共龙鬬。\n又闻蜀国玉局观有孙遇蹟，蟠屈身长八十尺。\n游人争看不敢近，头覻寒泉万丈碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}